msgctxt "64"
msgid ""
"You can't trust Suzuki <Italic>or</Italic> Tamiya. Both of 'em talked about "
"expanding the military base and building a resort around a year ago, and it "
"fell through."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"It'll be the same this time, too. And you can be sure they're still not "
"going to do anything to help the homeless."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "624"
msgid "Informed Homeless Man"
msgstr ""
